Package: ST4
Title: Sample Unit Size and Number for Seabed Image Surveys
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Adam", "Ward", , "adamwa@noc.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to choose sample unit size and number of sample units
    for photographic seabed surveys, following Durden et al. (2016).
    Metrics are calculated by vegan.
